@startuml
scale 100 as 100 pixels

robust "Job Periodic (Telemetrie)" as Periodic
concise "Job Aperiodic (Executie Comanda)" as Aperiodic
robust "Stare Alarma (T > Prag)" as AlarmState
robust "Generare Mesaj MQTT Alarma" as AlarmMQTT

@0
Periodic is "Perioada 2000ms"
Aperiodic is Idle
AlarmState is Normal
AlarmMQTT is Idle

@2
Periodic is "Perioada 2000ms"
AlarmState is "Depasire (T=28.42)"
AlarmMQTT is "Generare Alarma (OK)"
note bottom of AlarmMQTT : t=2s: Trimis pe topic alarm\nResetare timestamp ultima alarma

@2.3
AlarmMQTT is Idle

@4
Periodic is "Perioada 2000ms"
AlarmState is "Depasire (T=28.15)"
AlarmMQTT is Idle
note bottom of AlarmMQTT : t=4s: Blocat de MIN_INTERARRIVAL\n(Au trecut doar 2s < 5s)

@4.5
AlarmState is Normal

@6
Periodic is "Comutare Perioada"
Aperiodic is "Procesare SET_INTERVAL 1000"
note top of Aperiodic : t=6s: Receptie comanda\nTrimitere OK pe /status

@6.2
Aperiodic is Idle
Periodic is "Perioada 1000ms"

@7
Periodic is "Perioada 1000ms"

@8
Periodic is "Perioada 1000ms"

@9
Periodic is "Perioada 1000ms"

@10
Periodic is "Perioada 1000ms"

@enduml
